  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1504.16 Blasting Notes. Any plans for a project that will entail blasting shall include the blasting best management practices specified in Env-Wq 1510.\n\nSource. #12342, eff 8-15-17; renumbered by #13758 (formerly Env-Wq 1504.17); ss by #14472, eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES: 1-19-36",
